-- TESTS for the open items (row IL-34). The one open item the row names as a rule: the Institute's extra charge on a yeshiva student who has not regularised his
-- military status is refused by name. The 95 NIS the Institute's page prints is not used anywhere: it is not law.

§ `Tests: open items`

#ASSERT REFUSED `the extra monthly charge on a yeshiva student who has not regularised his military status` BECAUSE "the Institute's charge on a yeshiva student who has not regularised his military status is not in any deposited text"
